---
description: Keep code small and simple in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

Full rules: `AGENTS.md` ("Simplicity"). Summary:

- Smallest change that satisfies the task. No new file, class, Protocol, setting, or flag unless needed.
- Only the five ports in `src/bcra_rag/ports/`. Prefer plain functions and dataclasses.
- Function <= 40 statements, <= 10 branches, <= 5 params; file <= 400 lines.
- No `except Exception`, no swallowed errors, no `Any`/`getattr`/`type: ignore` shortcuts.
- Delete obsolete code. No shims, no speculative config.
- Tests: one per behaviour, reuse fakes; no layout or copy-text tests.
- If a task seems to need an abstraction, ask first.
